{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/120260-abyssal-soul-seperation","id":120260,"title":"Abyssal soul seperation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-27T02:55:05-07:00","id":120260,"title":"Abyssal soul seperation","content":"An idea I've had knocking around in my head for a while is of Abyssals taking and abusing the idea of soul separation on death by doing so and rejoining as it suits them whilst still being linked<ul><li>Hun higher soul - as standard ghost but with all non physical abyssal powers as well - primary seat of the conciousness</li> <li>Po - the Beast - hungry soul with a power boost - is let off the leash</li> <li>The body - mindless living zombie - has access to abyssal physical charms</li> <li>The exaltation - Can be placed in other objects or people for one ring shenanigans or a mirror of power awarding prana</li> </ul>this could be further extended with lich themes where you have to break each components connection to the others to kill the entire abyssal. <br /> do you think this can be done without being insanely broken?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-27T03:50:18-07:00","id":120268,"title":"","content":"Not sure how I feel about treating the Exaltation as a separate component.<br /> I have however previously considered a Void Circle Necromancy spell that interacts with the two Onyx Circle Spells Links Born of Tumult (I detach my Po) Crystal Ghost Shard (I detach my Hun) that makes the Abyssal still count as &qu